OL,3,GNEWSADeadly sea crashes 55 years ago
OL,4,Achanged shipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of disasters in the English
OL,7,FChannel which claimed 50 lives in 1971
OL,8,Fhelped bring about safety measures that
OL,9,Fare still used today, a former
OL,10,Fcoastguard has said.
OL,12,FThe incidents unfolded in the Dover
OL,13,FStrait, one of the world's busiest
OL,14,Fshipping routes, 55 years ago. Guidance
OL,15,Fexisted for vessels travelling through
OL,16,Fthe strait, but compliance was not
OL,17,Fcompulsory at that point.
OL,19,FRetired coastguard Pete Legg told
OL,20,FSecret Kent: "There was a traffic
OL,21,Fseparation scheme at that time, but it
OL,22,Fwas not mandatory."
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
